BT 1 0 0 1 0 45.3 Tm /F1 8.7 Tf 10.8 TL (This assignment built a complete supervised learning pipeline from raw Titanic data to a final model comparison across nine) Tj T* (classifiers. Careful preprocessing, stratified evaluation, and explicit interpretability analysis showed that a simple Decision Tree can) Tj T* (outperform ensemble methods when features are low-dimensional and highly predictive. The most important result is not which) Tj T* (model won numerically, but that the analysis exposes a concrete trade-off: the Rule-Based Tree loses 10 F1 points relative to the) Tj T* (best tree, but gains full human-readable explainability \227 a trade-off that matters enormously in any real deployment context.) Tj T* ET
